{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05596","headline":"赠司勳萧郎中 · 张子容","name":"赠司勳萧郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"作相开黄阁，爲郎奏赤墀。\n君臣道合体，父子贵同时。\n国以推贤答，家无内举疑。\n凤池真水镜，兰省得华滋。\n未覩风流日，先闻新赋诗。\n江山清谢朓，花木媚丘迟。\n吏部来何暮，王言念在兹。\n丹青无不可，霖雨亦相期。\n昔我投荒处，孤烟望岛夷。\n羣鸥终日狎，落叶数年悲。\n渔父留歌咏，江妃入兴词。\n今将献知己，相感勿吾欺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张子容","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05596.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05596","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}